    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nRedundant assertions are not checked in runtime code.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nEnable EmmyLua's `unnecessary-assert` diagnostic. Remove redundant\r\nassertions, correct optional map types, and use `vim.validate` for public\r\nAPI argument checks.\r\n",
